deny out/go/android/app/src/main/java/test/sngl/app/MainScreen.kt `fun fib` -- under --lang go the function lives in the module, so Kotlin declares no copy of it
unverifiable out/go/android -- the emitted project consumes a golib.aar produced by a `gomobile bind` step that generation does not perform
-- which is what made this
reachable at all, and why a non-recursive fixture would prove nothing.

The module exports it.

The Kotlin calls it there, and imports it.
